},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_NONE","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":4020001,"initDialog":402000101,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[2613],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/EQ/V5.8YLYZ_40200/Q4020001","priority":5,"questId":40200,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":402000101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2613,"speakerName":"Yelan","textMapHash":2593563026,"text":"What a nice night...","nextNodeIds":[402000102]},{"nodeId":402000102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2613,"speakerName":"Yelan","textMapHash":741044146,"text":"Fresh Romaritime Flowers, fragrant perfume from the shop on the corner, the rich aroma of coffee beans, all blended together in the night breeze... Makes for quite the relaxing atmosphere.","nextNodeIds":[402000103]},{"nodeId":402000103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2613,"speakerName":"Yelan","textMapHash":3758016498,"text":"If only we were on a rooftop terrace somewhere, enjoying a few glasses of sparkling wine and getting pleasantly tipsy...","nextNodeIds":[402000104,402000105]},{"nodeId":402000104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2832619890,"text":"Hey, you're on vacation now! Why not?","nextNodeIds":[402000106]},{"nodeId":402000106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2613,"speakerName":"Yelan","textMapHash":1906705482,"text":"Alright... Then let's look for a place to stop. I wonder what special drinks the hidden taverns of this city offer...","nextNodeIds":[402000107]},{"nodeId":402000107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2613,"speakerName":"Yelan","textMapHash":3806804850,"text":"Ah, but first. I wanted to head to the Confrerie of Cabriere before it closes. Mind helping me pick out some perfume to go with this outfit?","nextNodeIds":[402000108]},{"nodeId":402000108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2613,"speakerName":"Yelan","textMapHash":2102122314,"text":"I also heard about the intricate timepieces, clockwork furnishings, and fine jewelry you can get around here. There should be quite a few souvenirs worth perusing.","nextNodeIds":[402000109,402000110]},{"nodeId":402000109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":398499002,"text":"The longer you work, the more you want to spend?","nextNodeIds":[402000111]},{"nodeId":402000111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2613,"speakerName":"Yelan","textMapHash":1326062210,"text":"Well, with the most cultured traveler in all of Teyvat by my side, I should take advantage of this opportunity. I'm counting on you not to steer me wrong...","nextNodeIds":[402000112]},{"nodeId":402000112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2613,"speakerName":"Yelan","textMapHash":981989818,"text":"Mm, I'm satisfied. This has been a nice trip abroad... a very nice trip indeed.","nextNodeIds":[402000113]},{"nodeId":402000113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2613,"speakerName":"Yelan","textMapHash":1206889578,"text":"I wish I could take my time, maybe extend my stay a few more days. No one likes to be rushed on vacation.","nextNodeIds":[402000114,402000115]},{"nodeId":402000114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3978645834,"text":"Wait, I thought you were going to enjoy your time off?","nextNodeIds":[402000116]},{"nodeId":402000116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2613,"speakerName":"Yelan","textMapHash":2112875754,"text":"It can't be helped. Duty calls.","nextNodeIds":[402000117]},{"nodeId":402000117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2613,"speakerName":"Yelan","textMapHash":1819082258,"text":"I still have to write up a formal report on the case and help develop a more sophisticated cargo inspection system. Then, I'm off to the location of my next assignment...","nextNodeIds":[402000118]},{"nodeId":402000118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2613,"speakerName":"Yelan","textMapHash":1675361490,"text":"Nod-Krai.","nextNodeIds":[402000119,402000120]},{"nodeId":402000119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2285674122,"text":"That's where Paimon and I are headed next, too.","nextNodeIds":[402000121]},{"nodeId":402000121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2613,"speakerName":"Yelan","textMapHash":4120766882,"text":"No, nothing like that. Just meeting an intelligence partner to decide on a mutually-beneficial agreement going forward, and to set some boundaries.","nextNodeIds":[402000122]},{"nodeId":402000122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2613,"speakerName":"Yelan","textMapHash":2220207778,"text":"I'll fill you in later. For now, why don't we take a picture together to commemorate this exciting trip to Fontaine?","nextNodeIds":[402000123,402000124]},{"nodeId":402000123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1059575066,"text":"And you taking me under your wing.","nextNodeIds":[402000125]},{"nodeId":402000125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2613,"speakerName":"Yelan","textMapHash":2571324706,"text":"#That's right. After this, I know I can trust you to have my back, {NICKNAME}. Or should I say... Agent.","nextNodeIds":[402000126]},{"nodeId":402000126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2613,"speakerName":"Yelan","textMapHash":2768856210,"text":"I say we put the Forensic Imaging Device to use one last time to take this picture.","nextNodeIds":[402000127]},{"nodeId":402000127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2613,"speakerName":"Yelan","textMapHash":2003749978,"text":"Perhaps we'll cross paths in Nod-Krai. If so, I hope this collaboration was just the first of many.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":402000124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3026436362,"text":"And the success of our operation.","nextNodeIds":[402000125]},{"nodeId":402000120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2539650858,"text":"Is your business there urgent? Has something happened?","nextNodeIds":[402000121]},{"nodeId":402000115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1914916698,"text":"Why does it sound like you're about to get back to work?","nextNodeIds":[402000116]},{"nodeId":402000110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":52447834,"text":"Alright, I'm down for a shopping spree!","nextNodeIds":[402000111]},{"nodeId":402000105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2859499338,"text":"You deserve to celebrate! Let's cheers to a job well done!","nextNodeIds":[402000106]}]},{"talkId":4020002,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":true,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":true,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","beginCond":[{"param":["4020001","2","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_NONE","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":4020002,"initDialog":402000201,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[15399,15504],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/WQ/YLYZ_40200/Q4020002","priority":5,"questId":40200,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":402000201,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15504,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1649320058,"text":"So you're saying that Officer Fonck is going to take us to where the bad guys are being questioned, right?","nextNodeIds":[402000202]},{"nodeId":402000202,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15399,"speakerName":"Edler","textMapHash":4076319042,"text":"That's right. We're giving you the chance to check out our secret base...","nextNodeIds":[402000203]},{"nodeId":402000203,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15399,"speakerName":"Edler","textMapHash":463014546,"text":"Haha, I'm only joking. To make sure we don't disturb everyone's day-to-day work, we've set up shop in a remote house. Once we set off, you'd better stay close to me, okay?","nextNodeIds":[402000204]},{"nodeId":402000204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15504,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1988660034,"text":"#Don't worry! Paimon's a very experienced guide, she and {NICKNAME} have been to all sorts of confusing places. No way she'll get lost in Fontaine!","nextNodeIds":[402000205]},{"nodeId":402000205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15504,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3483703050,"text":"#Ah, {NICKNAME} is here.","nextNodeIds":[402000206]},{"nodeId":402000206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15504,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3565250122,"text":"That was quick! Is Yelan one of those close-your-eyes-for-a-second-and-okay-that's-enough-rest-let's-get-back-to-work sort of people?","nextNodeIds":[402000207,402000208]},{"nodeId":402000207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":489893426,"text":"We haven't started our vacation yet.","nextNodeIds":[402000209]},{"nodeId":402000209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15504,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":461675498,"text":"Hehe, Paimon's fine, there's no need to worry. You're not the only one who can grow!","nextNodeIds":[402000210]},{"nodeId":402000210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15504,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":939061172,"text":"Everything's been taken care of, so you and Yelan can go and enjoy your holiday!","nextNodeIds":[402000211]},{"nodeId":402000211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15504,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2862642626,"text":"Throw all your troubles aside and have fun!","nextNodeIds":[402000212]},{"nodeId":402000212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15399,"speakerName":"Edler","textMapHash":3086434298,"text":"And for my part, I'll make sure Inspector Paimon's well looked after. Whatever she wants to learn, whatever she wants to eat, we'll ensure her needs are met!","nextNodeIds":[402000213,402000214]},{"nodeId":402000213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3356842754,"text":"I'll be on my way then!","nextNodeIds":[402000215]},{"nodeId":402000215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15504,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3885920090,"text":"Paimon's gonna make a really good student inspector!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":402000214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3922652330,"text":"Good luck, Paimon!","nextNodeIds":[402000215]},{"nodeId":402000208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3166168314,"text":"I was a little worried, so I came by to check up on you.","nextNodeIds":[402000209]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[4020001,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["4020201","1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_SET_QUEST_GLOBAL_VAR"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["2613"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[4020001,4020002],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2613,"speakerName":"Yelan","count":17},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","count":14},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15504,"speakerName":"Paimon","count":8},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15399,"speakerName":"Edler","count":3}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","BEGCMMJKCFC":[140200],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":2516048510,"CHECNJEMEFE":{},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_ACTIVITY","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":true,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{},"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GBFMDJLKJBF":[],"GMENNHMBBOH":[],"HCJHEADFCAO":0,"IBEGAHMEABP":[{"<DLGBBMLABOA>k__BackingField":0,"ABDCADBLCFC":0,"AIMIPKGBAHC":"QuestDialogue/EQ/V5.8YLYZ_40200/Q4020001","ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","AOLKCANJCMJ":5,"BKDENCDKDEE":"","BPIIFMJLJAJ":[],"DAMGEPEMGNO":false,"DBACCKDPONG":[],"DIAFFIANKPH":false,"DKOMBMCJMMN":false,"EFBOKHEHKJM":[],"EIDINNIHMHD":false,"EKANPNMEFMG":[],"ENDBMMDPPAH":[],"FALLCBHGKON":"LOGIC_NONE","GEPGLHFDBNF":[],"GLJMLHNKKKO":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","HJFLPAICAEO":false,"HNFEAICLPLM":[],"HPPIPDNHFJG"